": \"text\", \"q\": \"All analyses were conducted using SAS-callable SUDAAN (version 11.0.4; RTI International) to account for the complex sampling design and weighting.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}